      "year": -323
    },
    "precision": "month",
    "uncertainty": {
      "note": "Livius: left Patala on 15 September (year not stated on the page); Smith's Dictionary: departed the Indus on 21 September 325 BC, reached Harmozia on 9 December, reached Susa in February 324. Livius says Harmozeia was reached in early 324. The two pages differ by days and on the Harmozeia date. Years are astronomical (325 BCE = -324, 324 BCE = -323)."
    },
